GAME DATA IN THIS REPOSITORY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

rulekit reads a corpus of JSON files. It works with any rulebook, and it holds
no knowledge of any particular game. The corpora in data/ are examples.

  data/demo/       An invented game, written for this project. Dedicated to the
                   public domain under CC0 1.0. Copy it freely.

  data/riftbound/  Reference data for the Riftbound trading card game. This data
                   is the property of Riot Games, Inc. The Apache License does
                   NOT cover it, and this project grants no rights to it.

rulekit was created under Riot Games' "Legal Jibber Jabber" policy using assets
owned by Riot Games. Riot Games does not endorse or sponsor this project.

Riot's policy permits non-commercial community use only. To use rulekit
commercially, supply your own corpus. data/demo/ is public domain and is a
working starting point. docs/corpus-format.md states the format field by field.

Riftbound and Riot Games are trademarks of Riot Games, Inc. This project names
them only to say which data it reads.
